Package: betaLB
Title: Likelihood-Based Confidence Intervals for Regression Effect Sizes
Version: 0.0.0.9002
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Ivan Jacob Agaloos",
           family = "Pesigan",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "r.jeksterslab@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4818-8420"))
Description: Generates profile likelihood confidence intervals
    for standardized regression coefficients (beta) and other effect sizes,
    including multiple correlation, semipartial correlations,
    improvement in R-squared, squared partial correlations,
    differences in standardized regression coefficients,
    and Cohen's f-squared, for models fitted by lm().
URL: https://github.com/jeksterslab/betaLB, https://jeksterslab.github.io/betaLB/
BugReports: https://github.com/jeksterslab/betaLB/issues
